Package: mlr3pseudovalue
Title: Pseudo-Value Reduction Pipeline Operators for 'mlr3proba'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bela", "Hassan", , "Laurin.Hassan@campus.lmu.de", role = "aut"),
    person("Andreas", "Bender", , "bender.at.R@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5628-8611"))
  )
Description: Extends the 'mlr3proba' survival ecosystem with the pseudo-value
    reduction: survival times are replaced by pseudo-observations, the
    jackknife contributions of a non-parametric estimator of the survival
    probability or of the restricted mean survival time at one or more fixed
    time points. Pipeline operators turn a survival task into a regression
    task on these pseudo-values and map the regression predictions back to a
    survival prediction, so that any regression learner can be used for
    time-to-event data.
